  "cited_article_id": "configure-provider-calendar",
  "reply": "Please update your schedule in Settings > Scheduling > Provider Hours. Select your name, adjust the weekly start/end times or mark \"Day Off\" for the days you are not working, then click \"Add Block\" to create the afternoon admin block with the appropriate reason. Save the changes. If the calendar still shows the wrong availability, clear your browser cache and verify that no conflicting Facility Hours overrides exist and that your primary time zone matches the clinic’s main location."
}
